   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EAC, JFA Partnership Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudm&#xe5;let med EAC och PArtnerskapsfonden &#xe4;r att arbeta f&#xf6;r           implementering av                                                      EACs f&#xf6;rdrag i syfte att st&#xe4;rka den regionala integrationen och den  socioekonomiska utvecklingen i EACs samarbetsstater.Fonden  fokuserar och prioriterar aktiviteter kring st&#xe4;rkandet av institutionell        kapacitet, studier, program etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the EAC and its Fund is to promote the       implementation of the EAC Treaty with a view to enhance regional      integration and socio-economic development of the EAC Partner States. The fund will focus on, and prioritise, activities regarding the      building of institutional capacity, studies, programmes etc.</narrative>
  </description>
